{"ref":"BDB, רָמָה³","hw":"רָמָה³","html":"† I. <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">רָמָה</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. cast, shoot (</strong>Assyrian <em>ramû</em>, <em>throw, lay;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">رَمَى</span> <em>throw, shoot;</em> Ethiopic ረመየ: <em>strike, aim a blow at;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">רְמָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܪܡܳܐ</span> <em>cast, throw</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span>, subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:1\" href=\"/Exodus.15.1\">Ex 15:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:21\" href=\"/Exodus.15.21\">21</a> (song), c. acc. + <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּיָּם</span>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹמֵה קֶשֶׁת</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.29\">Je 4:29</a> coll. (or read <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹמֵי</span>) <em>bow-shooters, bowmen,</em> pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">נוֹשְׁקֵי רוֹמֵי־ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:9\" href=\"/Psalms.78.9\">ψ 78:9</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, נָשַׁק²\" href=\"/BDB,_נָשַׁק²\", dir=\"rtl\">II. נשׁק</a>); cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹבֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:20\" href=\"/Genesis.21.20\">Gn 21:20</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, רָבָה²\" href=\"/BDB,_רָבָה²\", dir=\"rtl\">II. רבה</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, קַשָּׁת\" href=\"/BDB,_קַשָּׁת\", dir=\"rtl\">קַשָּׁת</a>).","next":"BDB, רָמָה⁴","prev":"BDB, רֵם"}